msgid "Placer"
msgstr "Place"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:815
msgid "Forme non configurée"
msgstr "Shape not configured"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:827
msgid "Racks"
msgstr "Racks"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:827
msgid "Devices non rackés"
msgstr "Non-racked devices"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:849
msgid "Aucun objet disponible."
msgstr "No objects available."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:881
msgid "Cliquez sur un objet placé sur le plan pour voir ses propriétés."
msgstr "Click on an object placed on the plan to see its properties."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:907
msgid "Rotation (°)"
msgstr "Rotation (°)"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:927
msgid "Aimanter au mur"
msgstr "Snap to wall"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:935
msgid "Hors des murs"
msgstr "Outside walls"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:942
msgid "Position du nom"
msgstr "Name position"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:996
msgid "Retirer du plan"
msgstr "Remove from plan"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1231
msgid "Zone %(number)s sélectionnée"
msgstr "Zone %(number)s selected"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1239
msgid "— Aucun local —"
msgstr "— No location —"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1255
msgid "Associer à la zone %(number)s"
msgstr "Associate with zone %(number)s"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1262
msgid ""
"Voulez-vous vraiment délier le local « %(location_name)s » de la zone %"
"(number)s ? Une fois enregistré, l'onglet \"Plan\" disparaîtra de la page de "
"ce local, le numéro de zone réapparaîtra sur le plan à la place de son nom, "
"et les devices/racks posés dans cette zone en seront retirés (ils resteront "
"dans leur local NetBox, mais ne seront plus placés sur le plan)."
msgstr ""
"Do you really want to unlink location « %(location_name)s » from zone %"
"(number)s? Once saved, the \"Plan\" tab will disappear from this location's "
"page, the zone number will reappear on the plan in place of its name, and "
"the devices/racks placed in this zone will be removed from it (they will "
"remain in their NetBox location, but will no longer be placed on the plan)."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1283
msgid "Cliquez sur une zone du plan pour l'associer à un local."
msgstr "Click on a zone of the plan to associate it with a location."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1286
msgid "Chargement des locaux…"
msgstr "Loading locations…"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1290
msgid "Erreur lors du chargement des locaux."
msgstr "Error while loading locations."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1319
msgid "%(saved)s association(s) enregistrée(s)."
msgstr "%(saved)s association(s) saved."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:1325
msgid "Erreur réseau lors de l'enregistrement."
msgstr "Network error while saving."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:159
msgid ""
"%(unchanged)s zone(s) inchangée(s), %(removed)s zone(s) supprimée(s) "
"(%(objects)s objet(s) posé(s) seront retirés), %(created)s nouvelle(s) "
"zone(s)."
msgstr ""
"%(unchanged)s zone(s) unchanged, %(removed)s zone(s) removed "
"(%(objects)s placed object(s) will be removed), %(created)s new zone(s)."

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:174
msgid "Appliquer"
msgstr "Apply"

#: static/netbox_cadplan/js/plan_editor.js:181
msgid "Annuler"
msgstr "Cancel"
